<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">YUD Soli Bible 65</book>
  <para style="h">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yuda</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuda</para>
  <para style="imt">BUSANSUUSHI</para>
  <para style="ip">Kusansulula libuku lya Yuda. Kalata ikute kukwiweti Yuda yalalembewa ne mwine Yuda. Yuda walalisansulula eti ni mukwabo Jemusi kayi ne mukwabo Yesu. Neco cila bonekengeti ni mukwabo Yesu (Yud 1 ) Nomba nkatucinshi cena na kalata iyi yalalembelwa ku mubungano uli onse, nomba pacebo cakwamba sha mumabala amucipangano cisa cakaindi, mpani Yuda walalembela ku bantu ba Ciyuda. Necikabeco, kalata iyi walailembela kuli bantu bonse abo balakwiwa kayi basunika kuli Lesa Bata kayi abo babambililwa Yesu Klistu (Yuda 1). Kalata iyi yalalembewa mucaka ca 60 A.D. Kalata iyi walailembela kuli baklistu bonse kubacenjesha kwambeti, nkabatakonkanga beshi kwiyisha bandemishibili (Yud 4). Yuda kayi lasebenseshenga mabala amucipangano cisa cakaindi nebyo byalikwinshika kwambeti abisansulule cena kubantu. Kalata iyi yakoshanako ne kalata yatubili ya Petulo palwinshibo lwa beyishi bandemishibili Yuda 4, 2 Petulo 2:1 Ne pacebo cabangelo kayi ne sha Sodomu ne Gomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakutanguna Yuda lambilinga bbeshi kubala kalata iyi Yuda 1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Lasansululunga ncalalembelenga kalata iyi pacebo cakubacenjesha pali beshi kwiyisha bandemishibili Yuda 3-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Panyuma pakendi labapanga mikoshanyo mumabala amucipangano cakaindi Yuda 5-16. Kayi labambilinga mobelela kuba kumbwila abo balico Yuda 17-23. Cakupwililisha lalumbunga Lesa Yud 24-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Njame Yuda musebenshi wa Yesu Klistu, ndemukwabo Jemusi. Ndalembelenga njamwe omwalakwiwa ne Lesa omwekala mu lusuno lwa Lesa Bata omwashinkililwa ne Yesu Klistu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkumbo ne lumuno kayi ne lusuno lwesula bibe nenjamwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, ndayandishishanga kumulembela kalata kwambeti ndimwambile shalupulusho lwetu twense. Nomba lino ndabono kwambeti caina kumulembela nekumusenga mwangofu kwambeti mulwane nkondo yakucingilisha lushomo Lesa ndwalapa bantu kankanda kamowa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndamulembelenga pakwinga bantu nabambi batanyumfwili Lesa bakute kwiyisha biyisho byabwepeshi balengili pakati penu mwakutabenshiba. Aba ebantu mbwalamba Lesa mu Mabala Aswepa mumisemano yakunyuma kwambeti nakabape cisubulo. Pakwinga bakute kupindamuna makani alambanga lusuno lwa Lesa kwambeti, babepeshelemo bensanga bufule. Ebakute kukana Yesu Klistu Mwami wetu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino ndayandanga kumwanushako nabimbi nambi mubishi kendi, kwambeti Lesa walapulusha mushobo wa Islayeli kufuma ku Injipito, mpwalashina bonse babula kumushoma. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kayi kamwanukani bangelo balabula kwikuta ne bwendeleshi bwabo bwelela, balashiya musena Lesa ngwalabapa. Neco Lesa wabasunga ncetani shitapu mu mushinshe mpaka busuba bwalombolosho. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kayi kamwanukani minshi ibili ya Sodomu ne Gomola yalikuba yabambana. Umo bantu mobali kwinsa bufule ne bintu nabimbi byasafwana bitayandiki ku muntu. Lesa walabapa cisubulo kwambeti cibe cilesho kuli bonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nabo bantu aba balenshinga cimocimo, balakonkelenga maloto alepishinga mibili yabo, balakananga bwendeleshi bwa Lesa, balatukananga bilengwa byakwilu byalemekwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba Mikayeli mukulene wa bangelo mpobalikulondola ne Satana pakulwanina mubili wa Mose, uliya kumunyanshapo, walamboweti, “Lesa akukanse!” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba bantu aba bakute lisongwe ne pabintu mbyebateshi, balo ncobeshi ni mano acisemwa mbuli abanyama, ebintu bilabashininga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bakute malele pakwinga balakonkelenga nshila njalamanta Kaini. Kayi mbuli ncalensa Balamu, balawili mubwipishi cebo cakuyandishisha mali. Balamupandukili Lesa mbuli calensa Kola, neco naboyo balonongeke <verse number="12" style="v"/>Aba ebalepishinga mibungano yenu yalusuno. Baliya nsoni balalinga pamo ne njamwe, balayandangowa byabo. Balyeti makumbi ilanyakangwa ne mpepo, makumbi abula mfula. Balyeti bitondo bitaseme bisepo pacindi cakendi, bitondo ibyo bantu mbyebalashukulu miyanda bilafwililili. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Balyeti mankape apa lwenje, bakute kupulisha mapofu abintu byabo byasafwana. Balyeti nyenyenshi shilataiki nshila. Neco Lesa wabasungila mu mushinshe wanjobe bani utapu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enoki wamusemano wacisanu ne cibili kufumina kuli Adamu walalalukapo sha bantu aba mpwalambeti, “Bonani Lesa pamo ne bangelo batabelengeke lesanga <verse number="15" style="v"/>kombolosha bantu bonse. Kubapa cisubulo pancito shabo shaipa nshebalensa, kayi ne maswi abo aipa ngobalikumwamba.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Aba endibo beshikutungula, batalumbu bilenshinga banabo, beshikukonkelowa lunkumbwa lwaipa, beshikulitunta, beshikuyandowa kulyela masuku pamitwi ya banabo.</para>
  <para style="s">Kucenjesha ne malailile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nomba amwe anukani ncemwalambilwa nebatumwa ba Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Balamwambileti, “Mumasuba akumapwililisho, nikukabe bantu baminyansho, bantu beshikukonkela lunkumbwa lwabo.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Aba bantu ebakute kuleta kupansana, bakutekuyandowa byamucishi, mu myoyo yabo muliya Mushimu Uswepa sobwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nomba amwe nyumfwanani kwambeti buyumi bwenga pantangu kabuli bwashimpa pa lushomo lwaswepa. Kamupailanga mungofu ya Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ikalani mu lusuno lwa Lesa mpomulapembelelenga Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu uyo eshakamupe buyumi butapu munkumbo shakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Balesheni nkumbo abo bacitonshanya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba nabambi mubapulushe pakubasompola mumulilo. Nabambi mubaleshe nkumbo mwabuyowa, nsombi mupelane ne byakufwala byabo byatundubila ne lunkumbwa lwa bwipishi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bulemu bube kuli uyo wela kubula kumuleketi muwile mu bwipishi, uyo wela kumushikisha pamenso abulemu bwakendi kamuli mwabula kampenda kalikonse. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kuli Lesa mupulushi wetu kupitila muli Yesu Klistu Mwami wetu kube bulemu ne bukulene ne ngofu kayi ne bwendeleshi, kufumina cindi cakunyuma, pacino cindi kayi ne kucindi citapu! Ameni.</para>
</usx>
